target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节最后讨论一个函子（functor），它对应于一般分次环（graded ring）情形下的<MATH_0001>，<MATH_0002>为该分次环。建议读者跳过本节余下的内容。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n固定任意一个分次环（graded ring）<MATH_0003>。设<MATH_0004>为概形（scheme）。称三元组（triples）<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>（二者均在<MATH_0007>上，且整数（integers）<MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>可以不同）<TEXTITOPEN_0001>等价（equivalent）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若存在同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0010>，\n其两端均为<MATH_0011>上的可逆（invertible）层（sheaves），且<MATH_0012>和<MATH_0013>作为分次环（graded ring）映射（maps）<MATH_0014>一致。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:8bbb4d2fda614fc9f7bb05db0c3ee6a5d73515d652bda060bbb08b18bbd57a4a", "unit_id": "tag:01N4:prose-0003", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "本节末讨论的对应对象", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "讨论该函子时所取的一般环", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "定义三元组等价前固定的任意环", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "定义前给定的几何对象", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "被比较等价性的两个对象", "source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "两个三元组中允许不同的参数", "source_term": "integers", "target_term": "整数"}, {"context": "所定义的两个三元组之间的关系", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "等价条件中要求存在的层同构", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "修饰同构两端的层", "source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"context": "给定底对象上由同构连接的对象", "source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "限定所比较映射的类型", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "等价条件中要求一致的两个映射", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}]}
